Homepage: https://vedadb.io
Description: VedaDB - Multi-model database server
 VedaDB is a high-performance multi-model database supporting
 document, key-value, graph, and vector data models.
 .
 This package contains the VedaDB server, CLI client,
 benchmark tool, backup utility, and administration tools.
 .
 Features:
  - Multi-model: document, key-value, graph, vector, time-series
  - High-performance storage engine with query caching
  - Built-in authentication and access control
  - Prometheus-compatible metrics endpoint
  - RESTful HTTP API
  - Configurable via YAML configuration file
